#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:5 f92f4ec3a5d2476dba03c826686f5f0c
msgid "ROS 2 with SITL"
msgstr "ROS 2 与 SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:7 9354ad0ae8314f8391eaf6c56b9288fe
msgid ""
"After the ROS2 environment,  *Micro-XRCE-DDS-Gen* and the ROS2 package "
"*micro-ROS-Agent* are correctly installed following :ref:`Install ROS2 "
"<ros2>`, you still need to build the simulator of Ardupilot to launch SITL "
"in ROS2."
msgstr ""
"按照 :ref:`安装 ROS2 <ros2>` 正确安装 ROS2 环境、*Micro-XRCE-DDS-Gen* 和 ROS2 软件包 "
"*micro-ROS-Agent* 之后，您仍需构建 Ardupilot 的仿真器才能在 ROS2 中启动 SITL。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:9 c00135437d164e109079123cccc66f16
msgid ""
"The simulator will be built from the source code in the "
"*ardu_ws/src/ardupilot* that is cloned in :ref:`Installation (Ubuntu) "
"<ros2_installation_ubuntu>`."
msgstr ""
"仿真器将从 :ref:`安装（Ubuntu） <ros2_installation_ubuntu>` 中克隆到 "
"*ardu_ws/src/ardupilot* 的源代码构建。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:11 8b867a8a4f7948d984a3debac387cde0
msgid "You need to install the ArduPilot dependencies first."
msgstr "您需要先安装 ArduPilot 的依赖。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:18 f3027b5cab6f42818b56971bc7e20450
msgid ""
"Then, build Ardupilot for SITL with DDS enabled. The example below shows how"
" to build the copter firmware, but you can replace *copter* with *plane*, "
"*rover*, etc."
msgstr ""
"然后，构建启用 DDS 的 SITL 版 Ardupilot。以下示例展示了如何构建 copter 固件，但您可以将 *copter* 替换为 "
"*plane*、*rover* 等。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:20 7dc692182c72406a99e04853d2e5821e
msgid ""
"You can build the ROS2 packages *ardupilot_msgs*, *micro_ros_agent*, "
"*ardupilot_sitl* and *ardupilot_dds_tests* as"
msgstr ""
"您可以按如下方式构建 ROS2 软件包 *ardupilot_msgs*、*micro_ros_agent*、*ardupilot_sitl* 和 "
"*ardupilot_dds_tests*"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:28 20bb9f4a314c41849f86c15fba8df7b3
msgid "Then, source your workspace"
msgstr "然后，source 您的工作空间"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:36 1adc42309b1f4d019970236109c6595b
msgid "and you are able to launch the SITL in ROS2 with the following command"
msgstr "即可使用以下命令在 ROS2 中启动 SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:40 67fca972721149b08ebe940962d14685
msgid "ArduPilot 4.5"
msgstr "ArduPilot 4.5"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:63 3d6f688206d34d29b00bbb91572c30a6
msgid "ArduPilot 4.6 and later"
msgstr "ArduPilot 4.6 及更新版本"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:84 b28d1c7dac9c4d68803fa062aff66b2b
msgid ""
"More modules of `mavproxy <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/copter-sitl-"
"mavproxy-tutorial.html>`__ such as *map* and *console* can be added in the "
"above command. For example, *map:=True console:=True*."
msgstr ""
"上述命令中还可以添加更多 `mavproxy <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-"
"tutorial.html>`__ 模块，例如 *map* 和 *console*。示例：*map:=True console:=True*。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:86 178a2c1113fa446f802469e9fe0a6c5a
msgid "It launches three three processes:"
msgstr "它会启动三个进程："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:88 c36a7caf617147d49e5a6312b93573a3
msgid ""
"*micro-ROS-Agent* is a wrapper around *Micro-XRCE-DDS-Agent* and provides "
"connection to ROS2"
msgstr "*micro-ROS-Agent* 是对 *Micro-XRCE-DDS-Agent* 的封装，提供与 ROS2 的连接"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:89 cb27f5c3bae7476c80f30848bdbb0209
msgid ""
"*ardupilot_sitl*  is a ROS2 package that start the SITL binary connected to "
"ROS2 through *micro-ROS-Agent*"
msgstr ""
"*ardupilot_sitl* 是一个 ROS2 软件包，它启动通过 *micro-ROS-Agent* 连接到 ROS2 的 SITL 二进制程序"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:90 7680d38150964e11b474086163e1dff8
msgid "*mavproxy* is a GCS that connects to SITL through the MAVLink protocol"
msgstr "*mavproxy* 是通过 MAVLink 协议连接到 SITL 的地面站"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:92 27fe9bf52d1b4fbfbf054d39f7cb6943
msgid ""
"For more information refer to `ardupilot/Tools/ros2/README.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/ros2#readme>`__. "
"There you can find examples of launches using serial connection instead of "
"udp, as well as a step-by-step breakdown of what the launch files are doing."
msgstr ""
"更多信息请参阅 `ardupilot/Tools/ros2/README.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/ros2#readme>`__。其中包含使用串口连接（而非"
" UDP）的启动示例，以及对启动文件步骤的详细说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:96 58018772cb754eb9908503db7b197d58
msgid "ROS 2 CLI"
msgstr "ROS 2 CLI"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:98 075d741f0ee34dd1a13cda6a36305e95
msgid ""
"Once everything is running, you can now interact with ArduPilot through the "
"ROS 2 CLI."
msgstr "一切运行正常后，您现在可以通过 ROS 2 CLI 与 ArduPilot 交互。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:110 2de7cf8f0c0540398dbbd6d20fc79f2e
msgid ""
"DDS is responsible for ROS2 communication. If the ROS2 topics are not "
"published, first check if *DDS_ENABLE* is set to ``1`` or not. If not, set "
"as ``1``. It can be done through Mission Planner, QGroundControl, or the "
"commands in *mavproxy* as below, then reboot the launch."
msgstr ""
"DDS 负责 ROS2 通信。如果 ROS2 话题未发布，请先检查 *DDS_ENABLE* 是否设置为 ``1``。如果不是，请设置为 "
"``1``。可以通过 Mission Planner、QGroundControl 或如下 *mavproxy* 命令完成，然后重新启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:121 9658548dbdfd4a7081f97a540adbc3a4
msgid ""
"The second aspect to check, ensure the ArduPilot parameter "
":ref:`DDS_DOMAIN_ID<DDS_DOMAIN_ID>` matches your environment variable "
"``ROS_DOMAIN_ID``.The default is ``0`` for ArduPilot, which corresponds to "
"the environment variable being unset. You may need to relaunch the SITL "
"after changing the parameters."
msgstr ""
"第二个需要检查的方面：确保 ArduPilot 参数 :ref:`DDS_DOMAIN_ID<DDS_DOMAIN_ID>` 与您的环境变量 "
"``ROS_DOMAIN_ID`` 一致。ArduPilot 的默认值为 ``0``，对应于环境变量未设置的情况。修改参数后，您可能需要重新启动 "
"SITL。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:125 3bef31b3a0e7410da5878128ea692021
msgid "MAVProxy"
msgstr "MAVProxy"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:127 4d73fb974544425c935f3c56e86fd9f0
msgid ""
"To test and fly around, you can launch a `mavproxy "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial.html>`__ "
"instance in yet another terminal:"
msgstr ""
"要进行测试和飞行，可以在另一个终端中启动 `mavproxy <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/copter-sitl-"
"mavproxy-tutorial.html>`__ 实例："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:135 b43d8dfd9437429d9f90b5cd33af2c51
msgid "Next up"
msgstr "下一步"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:137 84038261f414454ba1a978c40c8c232c
msgid "Add Gazebo in :ref:`ROS 2 with Gazebo <ros2-gazebo>`"
msgstr "在 :ref:`ROS 2 与 Gazebo <ros2-gazebo>` 中添加 Gazebo"

